From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joshua Warren <816217+joshuaswarren@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:52:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: keep every mode on an external firmware 27 DCP

dcp->external is set only for T6030. The T6050 and T6041 dcpext are marked ext_failsafe, so the 120 Hz gate for the internal panel also refused their 60 Hz modes. Gate on neither flag.

(cherry picked from commit 3176918ba21e898d007ee9c45c4f8ca41ed548cd)
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb.c
index 0fdc3abe9..e9af504cd 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb.c
@@ -3050,7 +3050,7 @@ static bool dcp_mode_settable(struct apple_dcp *dcp,
 	 * survive a modeset, so refuse the rest until they are understood.
 	 */
 	if (dcp->fw_compat == DCP_FIRMWARE_V_27_0 && !dcp->external &&
-	    drm_mode_vrefresh(mode) != 120)
+	    !dcp->ext_failsafe && drm_mode_vrefresh(mode) != 120)
 		return false;
 
 	return true;
